  "label": "The chimpanzee is mapped as the 'beginning' of human evolution",
  "description": "The text 'the evolution of man' is mapped onto the visual of the chimpanzee, implying that the chimpanzee represents the primitive, ancestral stage of human evolution. This mapping is part of a racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by equating them with primates, suggesting an evolutionary gap and inferiority.",
